And now Mark Martin winning here.

02:13:16.180 --> 02:13:17.580
Who's going to win at Atlanta, Bill Weber?

02:13:18.500 --> 02:13:19.580
We'll have to wait and see.

02:13:19.680 --> 02:13:20.860
When we went there last fall,

02:13:20.980 --> 02:13:23.340
Bobby Labonte put a Pontiac in victory lane.

02:13:23.620 --> 02:13:24.780
Chevy's taken the first two.

02:13:25.000 --> 02:13:26.160
It was a Ford here in Vegas.

02:13:26.460 --> 02:13:27.500
Will it be Pontiac in Atlanta?

02:13:27.500 --> 02:13:28.580
We'll see next Sunday.

02:13:28.840 --> 02:13:29.540
Here's Jerry Punch.

02:13:30.030 --> 02:13:34.130
The show capital of the world play host of the greatest show in modern-day motorsports,

02:13:34.290 --> 02:13:39.430
NASCAR Winston Cup racing, and folks, 107,000 here and hopefully millions watching at home

02:13:39.430 --> 02:13:40.670
didn't go away disappointed.

02:13:41.010 --> 02:13:45.340
What a race and what a finish for Team Roush, five cars in the top ten.

02:13:45.880 --> 02:13:50.500
Bob, what a debut for the NASCAR Winston Cup Series at Las Vegas.

02:13:50.740 --> 02:13:51.980
Man, he was so doggone excited.

02:13:52.120 --> 02:13:55.920
It was great to see Mark Martin pull one off, and even though he had that problem,

02:13:56.220 --> 02:13:58.680
not knowing if he was going to finish that last lap, but he did.

02:13:59.120 --> 02:13:59.960
Congratulations, Jack.

02:14:00.000 --> 02:14:02.240
Russ and Mark Martin. Mark Martin

02:14:02.240 --> 02:14:04.040
wins the Las Vegas 400.

02:14:04.160 --> 02:14:06.040
Don't forget our coverage on

02:14:06.040 --> 02:14:07.960
ESPN2 and ESPN

02:14:07.960 --> 02:14:10.040
this coming week from Atlanta and live

02:14:10.040 --> 02:14:11.680
coverage of the Prime Star 500

02:14:11.680 --> 02:14:14.100
from Atlanta Motor Speedway here on ABC

02:14:14.100 --> 02:14:16.340
next Sunday afternoon.

02:14:16.790 --> 02:14:18.210
Thanks for joining us from here

02:14:18.210 --> 02:14:20.190
at Las Vegas. Now

02:14:20.190 --> 02:14:22.270
back to our wide world of sports

02:14:22.270 --> 02:14:23.710
studio in New York.

02:14:23.810 --> 02:14:25.910
Here's your host, John Saunders.

02:14:31.440 --> 02:14:35.430
as it celebrates this year its 50th anniversary.

02:14:38.830 --> 02:14:42.650
Darlington Raceway, it doesn't matter if you drive a Ford, Chevy, or Pontiac,

02:14:42.670 --> 02:14:46.400
or if your name is Gordon, Wallace, Jarrett, or Labonte.

02:14:46.700 --> 02:14:48.340
She'll bite you at any moment.

02:14:49.280 --> 02:14:53.400
Down through the years, her promoting corners have claimed the best of drivers.

02:14:53.920 --> 02:14:56.080
The Darlington Stripe is waiting for...
